<GenericPage title={page.title} hreflang={hreflang} lang="zh-CN" description={page.description} canonical={page.canonical} ogImage="" bodyHtml={`<div class="entry-content single-content"><div><div><div><div><h1 class="has-theme-palette-9-color has-text-color">常见问题</h1><p class="has-theme-palette-8-color has-text-color">常见问题（FAQ） <a href="/product/choline-chloride-60/" title="氯化胆碱 60% 饲料添加剂 - 中国玉米芯载体生产商供应">胆碱</a>, <a href="/product_category/vitamins/" title="维生素">维生素</a>及其他 <a href="/product/" title="饲料添加剂">饲料添加剂</a> <a href="/product/" title="饲料添加剂">产品</a> 以及我们的服务</p></div></div></div></div><div class="has-theme-palette9-background-color"><div><div><div><h2>关于我们公司的常见问题</h2><div class="alignnone"><div class="kt-active-pane-3 kt-pane-header-alignment-left kt-accodion-icon-style-basic kt-accodion-icon-side-left"><div><div class="kt-pane58_f95a85-56"><div><button class="kt-acccordion-button-label-show" type="button"><span><span>您是制造商吗？</span></span></button></div><div><div><p>我们不是一家工厂。相反，我们代表着产业集群中的龙头企业网络，是一家专业化的出口和服务平台公司。</p></div></div></div><div class="kt-pane58_8e037d-8a"><div><button class="kt-acccordion-button-label-show" type="button"><span><span>你们提供价格优势吗？</span></span></button></div><div><div><p>是的。我们的报价通常比直接出厂价更具竞争力。我们位于生产基地的中心地带，对成本和生产趋势有着深刻的洞察力，这使我们能够提供最佳的采购方案，同时确保产品质量符合客户的要求。</p></div></div></div><div class="kt-pane58_9664f7-89"><div><button class="kt-acccordion-button-label-show" type="button"><span><span>你们的主要优势是什么？</span></span></button></div><div><div><p>定价更具竞争力和透明度<br/>精简可靠的国际贸易服务<br/>深入的产品专业知识，为客户提供最实用、最有效的解决方案</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div><div><h3>关于您的问题</h3><p class="wp-block-paragraph">我们提供专业的技术指导和产品采购流程服务。</p><p><form action="" class="forminator-ui forminator-custom-form forminator-custom-form-299 forminator-design--default forminator_ajax" id="forminator-module-299" method="post"><input name="trp-form-language" type="hidden" value="zh"/></form></p><div class="forminator-row"><div class="forminator-field-name forminator-col forminator-col-12" id="name-1"><div class="forminator-field"><label class="forminator-label" for="forminator-field-name-1_6a607574c1c0c" id="forminator-field-name-1_6a607574c1c0c-label">名 <span class="forminator-required">*</span></label><input aria-required="true" autocomplete="name" class="forminator-input forminator-name--field" id="forminator-field-name-1_6a607574c1c0c" name="name-1" placeholder="" type="text" value=""/></div></div></div><div class="forminator-row"><div class="forminator-field-email forminator-col forminator-col-12" id="email-1"><div class="forminator-field"><label class="forminator-label" for="forminator-field-email-1_6a607574c1c0c" id="forminator-field-email-1_6a607574c1c0c-label">电子邮件地址： <span class="forminator-required">*</span></label><input aria-required="true" autocomplete="email" class="forminator-input forminator-email--field" id="forminator-field-email-1_6a607574c1c0c" name="email-1" placeholder="" type="email" value=""/></div></div></div><div class="forminator-row"><div class="forminator-field-phone forminator-col forminator-col-12" id="phone-1"><div class="forminator-field"><label class="forminator-label" for="forminator-field-phone-1_6a607574c1c0c" id="forminator-field-phone-1_6a607574c1c0c-label">电话号码</label><input aria-required="false" autocomplete="off" class="forminator-input forminator-field--phone" id="forminator-field-phone-1_6a607574c1c0c" name="phone-1" placeholder="" type="text" value=""/></div></div></div><div class="forminator-row"><div class="forminator-field-textarea forminator-col forminator-col-12" id="textarea-1"><div class="forminator-field"><label class="forminator-label" for="forminator-field-textarea-1_6a607574c1c0c" id="forminator-field-textarea-1_6a607574c1c0c-label">留言：</label><span class="forminator-description" id="forminator-field-textarea-1_6a607574c1c0c-description"><span>0 / 500</span></span><textarea class="forminator-textarea" id="forminator-field-textarea-1_6a607574c1c0c" maxlength="500" name="textarea-1" placeholder=""></textarea></div></div></div><p><input name="referer_url" type="hidden" value=""/></p><div class="forminator-row forminator-row-last"><div class="forminator-col"><div class="forminator-field"><button class="forminator-button forminator-button-submit">提交</button></div></div></div><p><input id="forminator_nonce" name="forminator_nonce" type="hidden" value="048889234e"/><input name="_wp_http_referer" type="hidden" value="/wp-json/wp/v2/pages/58?_fields=id%2Ctitle%2Cslug%2Ccontent"/><input name="form_id" type="hidden" value="299"/><input name="page_id" type="hidden" value="58"/><input name="form_type" type="hidden" value="default"/><input name="current_url" type="hidden" value="/faq/"/><input name="render_id" type="hidden" value="0"/><input name="action" type="hidden" value="forminator_submit_form_custom-forms"/><div class="forminator-edit-module"><small><a class="forminator-module-edit-link" href="/wp-admin/admin.php?page=forminator-cform-wizard&amp;id=299" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank" title="编辑表单">编辑表单</a></small></div></p></div></div></div></div><div class="has-theme-palette9-background-color"><div><div><div><h2>关于我们产品的常见问题</h2><div class="alignnone"><div class="kt-active-pane-3 kt-pane-header-alignment-left kt-accodion-icon-style-basic kt-accodion-icon-side-left"><div><div class="kt-pane58_51d920-6b"><div><button class="kt-acccordion-button-label-show" type="button"><span><span>你们提供哪些类型的饲料添加剂？</span></span></button></div><div><div><p>我们提供多种饲料添加剂，包括 <strong><a href="/zh/%e4%ba%a7%e5%93%81/%e6%b0%af%e5%8c%96%e8%83%86%e7%a2%b1-60/" title="氯化胆碱 60% 饲料添加剂 - 中国玉米芯载体生产商供应">氯化胆碱</a>, <a href="/product_category/vitamins/" title="维生素">维生素</a>, 氨基酸和矿物质添加剂</strong>适用于家禽、牲畜、水产养殖和宠物营养。</p></div></div></div><div class="kt-pane58_f497e3-f3"><div><button class="kt-acccordion-button-label-show" type="button"><span><span>氯化胆碱有哪些形式？</span></span></button></div><div><div><p>我们供应的氯化胆碱有 <strong>粉末</strong>不同的浓度，确保适用于各种饲料应用。</p></div></div></div><div class="kt-pane58_adeb5c-98"><div><button class="kt-acccordion-button-label-show" type="button"><span><span>您的产品符合国际质量标准吗？</span></span></button></div><div><div><p>是的。我们的所有产品都符合 <strong>FAMI-QS、GMP+、ISO 和其他国际认证</strong>确保安全、一致和可靠的性能。</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div><div><div class="alignnone"><div class="kt-active-pane-3 kt-pane-header-alignment-left kt-accodion-icon-style-basic kt-accodion-icon-side-left"><div><div class="kt-pane58_f39cbe-2f"><div><button class="kt-acccordion-button-label-show" type="button"><span><span>能否提供定制配方？</span></span></button></div><div><div><p>当然可以。根据客户的营养需求，我们可以推荐或提供 <strong>定制解决方案</strong> 以提高饲料效率和动物性能。</p></div></div></div><div class="kt-pane58_af4ae9-41"><div><button class="kt-acccordion-button-label-show" type="button"><span><span>你们的维生素和氨基酸有什么优势？</span></span></button></div><div><div><p>我们的维生素和氨基酸来源于 <strong>顶级制造商</strong>其特点是纯度高、质量稳定、价格具有竞争力。它们被广泛应用于世界各地的动物饲料配方中。</p></div></div></div><div class="kt-pane58_e4d236-16"><div><button class="kt-acccordion-button-label-show" type="button"><span><span>在贵公司的产品系列中，矿物质如何为动物营养提供支持？</span></span></button></div><div><div><p>我们的矿物添加剂（如 <strong>锌、锰、铜、硒</strong>)的目的是 <strong>提高免疫力、生长和饲料转化率</strong>支持动物的整体健康和生产力。</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="has-theme-palette9-background-color"><div><div><div><h2>关于出口运输的常见问题</h2><div class="alignnone"><div class="kt-active-pane-3 kt-pane-header-alignment-left kt-accodion-icon-style-basic kt-accodion-icon-side-left"><div><div class="kt-pane58_958534-5c"><div><button class="kt-acccordion-button-label-show" type="button"><span><span>你们能为我们办理出口手续吗？</span></span></button></div><div><div><p>是的。我们负责 <strong>所有与出口有关的流程</strong>包括文件编制、清关和国际物流。</p></div></div></div><div class="kt-pane58_7970aa-ef"><div><button class="kt-acccordion-button-label-show" type="button"><span><span>你们是否提供灵活的运输选择？</span></span></button></div><div><div><p>当然可以。我们与 <strong>多个货运代理和快递合作伙伴</strong> 提供海运、空运和快递服务，确保运输及时、经济高效。</p></div></div></div><div class="kt-pane58_ac098e-2a"><div><button class="kt-acccordion-button-label-show" type="button"><span><span>如何确保顺利和合规出口？</span></span></button></div><div><div><p>我们的团队拥有 <strong>在全球贸易法规方面拥有丰富经验</strong>确保产品符合目的地国家的要求，避免不必要的延误。</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div><div><figure class="size-large"><div><img alt="中国氯化胆碱和维生素饲料添加剂出口" height="683" src="/images/uploads/2025/08/China-Choline-Chloride-Vitamins-Feed-Additives-14-1024x683.jpg" width="1024"/></div></figure></div></div></div></div></div>`} />
